{
 "batchId": "b-0241",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_e5892aaef27b9993d2a1",
   "sourceHash": "e5892aaef27b9993d2a1b7230b0237b963f702bf720804d08b3c72519191ecd0",
   "text": "帕拉卡德（Palakkad）坐落于喀拉拉邦腹地，风景如画，以葱郁的绿意、深厚的文化底蕴和宁静的氛围而闻名。这个迷人的地区被誉为“喀拉拉之门”，将自然的宁静与传统的鲜活气息融为一体。Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 就位于帕拉卡德，是您探索这片迷人土地的理想据点，同时您可以沉浸于正宗的阿育吠陀疗法和整体健康调理之中。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'destination' rendered as '土地/地方' (neutral place wording) to avoid holiday/tourism framing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b366480159d04a6d7a11",
   "sourceHash": "b366480159d04a6d7a11910f8c4a1283f6374af1f3af0fa53f4216715de0447c",
   "text": "为什么要到访帕拉卡德？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c527bb6ea5dcb4de8048",
   "sourceHash": "c527bb6ea5dcb4de80483700f533d65c2a3ad231d1d7d33de4d39aba84e6fd92",
   "text": "帕拉卡德兼具自然之美与丰富的文化，是寻求宁静、身心焕新与探索的来访者的理想之地。以下是帕拉卡德与众不同的几个原因：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'travelers' rendered as '来访者' (visitors) per register guidance."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c657461633fce3a14359",
   "sourceHash": "c657461633fce3a143599880d0aa83a07031b57ab52e45df650bf9d9b8fe9710",
   "text": "壮丽自然",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f57fb86570b98efc65a1",
   "sourceHash": "f57fb86570b98efc65a1270cfedc631c073cd85b090708909a8754c35ef86900",
   "text": "壮丽自然：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b18fc8695e72f69fd5c8",
   "sourceHash": "b18fc8695e72f69fd5c85fb2917d5dad80c63576757f36ccabb3bac1d2c41881",
   "text": "帕拉卡德遍布一望无际的稻田、连绵起伏的山丘和宁静的河流。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_329f6c1f942a65aaf382",
   "sourceHash": "329f6c1f942a65aaf38227f18cc0153c869142078da8b9c4477350dc37da10aa",
   "text": "西高止山脉构成了壮观的背景，带来令人惊叹的景致和丰富多样的动植物。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_37d757ef3919b1384356",
   "sourceHash": "37d757ef3919b1384356d13c16c186b5e53797714c8a8cea50615121276225c6",
   "text": "附近的寂静谷国家公园（Silent Valley National Park）是世界上生态最多样化的地区之一。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_23016a5eb296a643e6dc",
   "sourceHash": "23016a5eb296a643e6dc8346410efeb7f909f496ed003b1aa37d653844bea841",
   "text": "深厚的文化底蕴",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6d48fb3990d2cf9b2573",
   "sourceHash": "6d48fb3990d2cf9b2573c18710eb4c453028aca5f177a6fcc54106bced16575f",
   "text": "深厚的文化底蕴：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dbee75d3e3f7335ce00e",
   "sourceHash": "dbee75d3e3f7335ce00e1b2233df6f7810cd60c69f10de8ed0ee7da59b18f94f",
   "text": "帕拉卡德拥有古老的寺庙、历史悠久的古堡，以及展现喀拉拉邦鲜活文化的传统节庆。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d48504473fdbe472de99",
   "sourceHash": "d48504473fdbe472de99d0d9b9fc7caa6317017ec2357b6d52e403467ca2331c",
   "text": "该地区通过卡塔卡利舞（Kathakali）、卡纳提克音乐和古典舞蹈等艺术形式传承着自身的文化遗产。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b7bc927cae734aac5145",
   "sourceHash": "b7bc927cae734aac51457904f9db7cfc2a03d7a17c6dbd247a1259874dac4c6c",
   "text": "物产丰饶",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1fb71f97e68df4ddccc2",
   "sourceHash": "1fb71f97e68df4ddccc22d43326347c620c4bce279bf0d1b577291c9a777dae0",
   "text": "物产丰饶：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f539f83d322f8e64f8c4",
   "sourceHash": "f539f83d322f8e64f8c4f13177cb39b20f42955cd72020e8d7e3c4c3882eada6",
   "text": "帕拉卡德常被称为“喀拉拉邦的米仓”，其肥沃的土地上遍布大片稻田、椰林和香料种植园。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0bb50ad514bb4c61c4df",
   "sourceHash": "0bb50ad514bb4c61c4dff9ed350b9d4caff086973a03125d2863a1ae99a44149",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village：您的身心疗愈之所",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Wellness Retreat' rendered as '身心疗愈之所' to avoid resort/holiday framing; brand name kept verbatim."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6bc4e253ab3f1aaa4630",
   "sourceHash": "6bc4e253ab3f1aaa4630878766179f4860785190afe87a06abb5b22e4eb04f6d",
   "text": "疗愈村坐落于帕拉卡德宁静的风景之中，是一处宁静安康的静养之地。在这里，您可以亲近自然，焕新身心，并探索帕拉卡德的文化瑰宝。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6752058cc3bdfa998175",
   "sourceHash": "6752058cc3bdfa998175c501436159680a51a1fc20057798702911eefc49bd75",
   "text": "健康调理项目：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_581c10cdbe8743b6f89b",
   "sourceHash": "581c10cdbe8743b6f89bd38769eef28f3daeed46b7564c219867d2ac628769f7",
   "text": "正宗阿育吠陀",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_23bc4bc8c37c3611dd98",
   "sourceHash": "23bc4bc8c37c3611dd98fb8615b50ba7bb6b6555a3aad4bf71af3febd4494a9d",
   "text": "：在资深医师的指导下，接受个性化的治疗与疗法，如 Panchakarma（潘查卡玛）、Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）和 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3982112dab0c96838b30",
   "sourceHash": "3982112dab0c96838b300f256b2e568c7544b0aec0abe86b0a686d31cfefc74b",
   "text": "正宗阿育吠陀：在资深医师的指导下，接受个性化的治疗与疗法，如 Panchakarma（潘查卡玛）、Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）和 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_86c711f1a8810ba5374d",
   "sourceHash": "86c711f1a8810ba5374dbe80a851040027ddc3b634e60fdfa9b635ce96a76e05",
   "text": "：参加每日课程，帮助身体、心智与精神达到和谐统一。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7a8645165fe93e72bf04",
   "sourceHash": "7a8645165fe93e72bf041df1612acf63418bb7fca1961d459b949ba9f1c5cf6d",
   "text": "瑜伽与冥想：参加每日课程，帮助身体、心智与精神达到和谐统一。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cca665df4d7d76f242d1",
   "sourceHash": "cca665df4d7d76f242d1a6c7f5c24bf6d32d4947dea95eaaf0d822c03d800937",
   "text": "可持续生活",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8c4c2b3c4d0f0a14cdfa",
   "sourceHash": "8c4c2b3c4d0f0a14cdfa6376e4c33676a5dd896f551687ba49d91c8bc60d69b1",
   "text": "：入住与自然环境和谐相融的环保小屋。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
